    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b008bb4a29e9fab89693526",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你究竟是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "43f1e4d688d90241df2b20abd74e84533551a1788b210a3ac006ce40bb4b6450",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1097/storytimeline_041097001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6afd31783b9e095c245ff9a9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "您究竟是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "61eb13a4d2f2a6d548a622f4387fbcefdc880ec51bb6a3efc6909a925cd016bc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1097/storytimeline_041097001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "choice_data_list",
        1
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/choice_data_list/1"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:451a7646c47e3464200d649f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那红色的瞳孔突然与我重叠……。眼前的赛马娘，\n仿佛一阵微风就能吹散般纤弱，却确实是那位她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a687b22184c6475fb767bfaad0fb6262bc839afdd7073018632ee77883692e5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1097/storytimeline_041097001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5679cf94970707f7675aeab9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱如往昔",
      "source_fingerprint": "700dee5173354f7b50adc1015a5eb201cda85290bc9a071978400ef72dbfc37f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1097/storytimeline_041097001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c55187c0158451c7600bbb02",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我是往昔。\n……爱如往昔――",
      "source_fingerprint": "111fd3221fe6dee68be64110c58b540f7a3af711acadc5b28c2b9f83fe9e52e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1097/storytimeline_041097001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f89ef3385dc967ec2f67b6b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "………………………………就　在　那　里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83a911f7cdd0c2eb31de1cc996cc870fa6842c865233879b9ecd0542df3ce008",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1097/storytimeline_041097001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6982eaffb5ade81378671e96",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "究竟从哪里算作开始才是正确的呢？如今已经无法分辨。\n但即使在朦胧的记忆中，最强烈的恐惧也总是伴随着回忆起――",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf0ff31fa996e0ed63d7f74013c0b3701be4e84d713db5beea20354e24a1ae05",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1097/storytimeline_041097001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44716402b6479b7dea73cba1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那个夏天。\n那一天，闷热得几乎让精神都腐烂。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b65ff11e3cebd3f89ef0148d7e89cc4f30d22f70619a74daa0bdcc8d3fbec165",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1097/storytimeline_041097001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dbd829b236c98dc644c6a17",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（不知不觉已经这么晚了……）",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e48c68f88890a5996ecf6cdf89c0e7f94832293abdcada80b3f8f5341ab33af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1097/storytimeline_041097001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10565dff62d0a5f78e97f5a9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在那个不知眠的夜晚，邂逅了最原始的本能……\n没错，那是在作为新人训练员协助外部工作回家的路上――",
      "source_fingerprint": "503f54af0c140d75109dd52aa104f6a9933d28a9e3c9fd36bc3243974c9c0471",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1097/storytimeline_041097001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:566c0a5f0905833c3ef16124",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（奇怪，明明很热……却感到一阵寒意）",
      "source_fingerprint": "24dd2a63350ed45272ac1d72b56391e21e1c01380a3dd54dc4e348bb95b98e22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1097/storytimeline_041097001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:454f992c2bcada8847fd8bfc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "突然发现自己不自觉地加快了脚步。即使已经长大，\n在无人夜晚的街道上，心中还是会泛起一丝不安与恐惧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3cc95907815d5290ef369a26a835d5571e9b190f51701602213f44101989a42",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1097/storytimeline_041097001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e824f3e01d6b5f78733da62",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "命运浓烈，血腥弥漫",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eaccff75ac9f5f61a1b4986257b35cc33391b56c8102a81c736de93189f5f8e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1097/storytimeline_041097001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48cd7bbd36025598cf48de59",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（咦？……她刚刚还在这里的）",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd80035ab33bfd110dd14ab8c7f44b82026862efa19b7c2cd5a842e4435967d8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
