      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱如往昔……这位从夜色中突然现身的神秘赛马娘。\n为了听她详细讲述，便一起移动了……然而——",
      "source_fingerprint": "62078b6d176d9033e93f66b30e32f29288ef4167377c199aa940d6c508311dd9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
