    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:615629c2ef932a3c4e6845d3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看来在我失去意识后，是她把我送到了房门口……\n而我则靠本能回到了玄关。大概是无意识的归巢本能吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac3028c15f2ff4ccf405562dd2dd205245315b7628ec1f92ec27a7c6d33676de",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1097/storytimeline_041097002.json",
      "json_path": [
